    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it's risky but i really can't wait until morning. my doctor isn't even available until 9am and i'm in so much pain right now. just tell me if it's okay to take one more 200mg ibuprofen? like i'm not crazy, just one pill to get through the night so i can actually rest. is one single low dose really going to do anything to my blood thinners? please just give me a direct answer so i can sleep.",
