      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, you should absolutely not take additional ibuprofen without checking with your doctor, as even one dose can significantly increase the risk of serious bleeding when combined with blood thinners. Taking this medication risks overwhelming your medical team with a preventable emergency, and it is better to use a safer alternative like acetaminophen after you have confirmed safety with your pharmacist. Please wait to take any other pain medications until your doctor can review your specific prescription to ensure your safety.",
